>particular your first rule lets a lot of stuff in from the outside that you 
>may not want.
>
>>>-A FORWARD -i eth1 -j ACCEPT
>>>-A FORWARD -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT
>>>-A FORWARD -i eth0 -o eth1 -j ACCEPT
